  "name": "Frightening Tune",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A bard of 14th level or higher can use his performance to cause fear in his enemies. To be affected, an enemy must be able to hear the bard perform and be within 30 feet. Each enemy within range receives a Will save (DC 10 + half of the bard's level + his Charisma modifier) to negate the effect. On a failed save, the target becomes frightened and flees for as long as it can hear the bard's performance. This is a fear effect that relies on audible components.</p>",
